{
  "id": "1CH.29",
  "number": "29",
  "bookId": "1CH",
  "reference": "1 Damanyoojiga 29",
  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "29",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 29"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "29",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Haleanjeeda siitayda jea eadeasa gheeda sibata ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwalamda sugoocheanda was Dawdi ak gwayeesha buuneeda sean bwat geat, “Orjeedeanyu was Sulemani, loat ASEETA gaba geaw, gudea mwanang' ak ea mii ghwanyas fughareeda, ak gadiyeeda aahaw; aba gideaba gheeda maygaba siida gaygaba NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak aba uurdeanyu sean ea neadiiwji haleanjeeda gheeda ASEETEANYU, dahaabu aba haleanjeeda dahaabu, lapiya aba haleanjeeda lapiya, gea dahaabu aba dahaabu, gharinga aba haleanjeeda gharinga, geediga aba haleanjeeda geediga; lagheanga sheayeeda haw, ea gea siinyiit, ea haleanjeeda musumaarajeega, ea gea heeluutka oormoojiga, ea lagheanga sheayeeda haw bea giliwas oorma ea lagheanga siguura marumaru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gicha iing'ata suh seaniin ea naawaamnyi aba badayda gheeda ghaydit, geandeawi haleanjeedeanyu eadiiwsi geaw bea dahaabu ea lapiya, iidu aba gideagasiidi gheeda ASEETEANYU ghaadawji gheeda ASEETEANYU. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea dalaantaji sagalamnyooji samwagu bea dahaabu, gea dahaabooda Ofiri, ea dalaantaji sagalamnyooji ispwa bea lapiyeeda siihuun, jea eedukuteawa ghamarda gheeda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gea dahaabu, aba haleanjeeda dahaabu, ea gea lapiya aba haleanjeeda lapiya, ea aba giliwas gadiya sisna geatinga gearnoodiga. Ak ea ng'eaha siida jea ghoadayda geaw aba gurooroadaanyi ak ghoaghaydiit geaw askweareani aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu ghoadayda fuga hees bea gealga ghweaniga nyaawa haleanjeeda ghadooweeda aba jeesinga nyaawa, gawuurji gisinda fuga hees bea eemoojiga, ea shirikareeda hees ambal sagalamnyooji ea bughalajeega sea fuga ahaaghwa ng'eanyiida sin gadiyeeda sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoadayda haleanjeeda aba gadiyeeda gheeda ASEETA, dahaabu dalaantaji sagalamnyooji muut, ea lapiyeeda hita sagalamnyooji damanamughuush bea dahaabu, ea lapiya dalaantaji sagalamnyooji damanamughuush, ea lagheanga sisna lapiya dalaantaji sagalamnyooji damasis, ea gharinga dalaantaji sagalamnyooji bughala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea siida wassean mideawa lagheanga sheayeeda haw ghwaat gheeda siitiiwshacheewa bea NG'UTAMIIDA, aba geatinda Yehieli bea eemeeda Gershoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gahoosan fugiga, aba gideaba ghoadayda haleanjeeda nea ghamwas jeesinga nyaawa, aba gideaba aba alooheeda gurooruunatka nyaawa, ea gidamwasta jeesinga nyaawa, ghoadaw haleanjeeda NG'UTAMIIDA; ak gahoosan muuchi eara sugoocheanda was Dawdi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dawdi ghoaghaambiit ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoaghaambiit Dawdi NG'UTAMIIDA, aba madeeda buuneesean bwat geat; ak gwayi Dawdi, “Deakghaambiinyi Ea NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA Israeli was ghweandeanya, damanda manda muudeanooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea NG'UTAMIIDA, hawunda daang'u, ea giimuusta, ea giigheambiita, ea jooriischooda, ea gheambalmeeda; aba gideaba haleanjeessean mida humng'eeda ea ng'eanyiida gaagu gil; gheambalmeeda daang'u, Ea NG'UTAMIIDA, ak ea siikghaambiinyi, ang'iing'i guwoosi haweewa haleanjeeda sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baruureega ea mureeda gwaleabu headaang'u ang'iing'i, ak giimbali haleanjeeda sean; nea geatingaagu gwanda giimuusta ea uurda; nea geatingaagu ghoamu gwasin ng'asheega hees nea gagu uurda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa ASEETEANYA, geebadiischooweey nea geakghaambiichi gheawungaagu ghaydit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Neada aniini geawooschi ng'eaha, ak fugeasu ea ng'eaha ea eeyi bwak ea eamuusa eatayda aba jeedeesh? Aba gideaba haleanjeeda sean gwaleabu headaang'u, nea aba jeeda haleanjeadaang'u ang'iing'i gea sigoonyeeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba aseasa geewooschi rabasta aba madeadaang'u, ea bareanoodiga gawuurji gidaghayi uurji ghweanigaasa sean; eaweagaasa gawuurji jirooneeda aba ng'eanyiida nea manda rarooda giibinda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea NG'UTAMIIDA, ASEETEANYA, haleanjeeni sean siitiiwiin, jea eadeasana gheeda aba gheawungaagu ghaydidiin, gwaleabu sean geatingaagu, nea sean ea gaagu gil ang'iing'i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghaanali aniini, ASEETEANYU, gideaba ang'iing'i iissa gisini guroorooda, ak gibwariinyi doobiiwnata. Nea aniini aba doobiiwnata gurooroodeanyu ghaadaydi haleanjeeni seaniin geagoonyi ghamwas jeedeanyu aniini; ak ghamneawa ea naadaayi aniini hooseaneega buuneadaang'u mida hiji, gagoonyi haleanjeeda nea ghamwas jeesinga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea NG'UTAMIIDA, ASEETA Abrahamu, ea dea Isaka, ea dea Israeli, was ghweanigaasa, fura ng'asheanji damanda manda muudeanooda aba fughareeda aba gurooruunatka buuneadaang'u, ak giidoobiiwsi gurooruunatka nyaawa gagalu headaang'u; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea orjeedeanyu was Sulemani, giidawi guroorooda miy, ak ghoang'waay diigheanyeakaagu, ea muuwwuunoadaang'u, ea ng'asheagaagu, ak gwasin ng'asheesu seaniin ak ghwadeas gheawi bea gheambalmeeda ghayi eadiiwsi haleanjeedean.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwalamda Dawdi ak gwayeesha buuneesean bwat geat, “Asi oakghaambiida NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETEANG'WA.” Hean ghoaghaambiit buuneesean NG'UTAMIIDA, ASEETA ghweaniga nyaawa, ak gabuy iheenga nyaawa, ak gwahiing'sa geat NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gwasin eara sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoadaw NG'UTAMIIDA haleanjeeda ghadooweeda, ak gwanuukusa NG'UTAMIIDA haleanjeeda ghadooweeda sighwarda, eaweeteaba iyeenya, was duuh sagalama, ea lagweendi sagalama ea gisil sagalama, ea haleanjeeda nyaawa bea ghadooweeda sileeha, ea haleanjeeda nyaawa saang'a bea ghadooweeda aba badayda Israeleeda sean; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gweagiischi nea gwaleeshi aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA eaweedida, nea gahoosan muuchi. Ak goombiit Sulemani, was orjeeda Dawdi, deabiyeenya, ak geamwaar aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak geanung' gwaheedu ak ghoah Sadoki ashoohoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goopteada Sulemani aba uhuuda hoorgeeda gheambalmeeda bea NG'UTAMIIDA, ghoah sugoocheanda gawa hoorgeeda Dawdi was ghwaan, ak ghwanyagaada; ak gwasissa mureeda buuneesean bea Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea fuga hees sean, ea fuga meanyi, sea orjooga sugoocheanda was Dawdi, gabassa geat geeshta sugoocheanda siguura Sulemani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gooheedu NG'UTAMIIDA muuchi Sulemani aba madeeda gheanyanga Israeleesean, ak ghoadaw hawunda sugoocheanduumeeda ea ghang'al sugoocheanda wassean ghayi mida madeadaanyi aba jeeda Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'asheega siinuwaas bea sugoocheanduumeeda Dawdi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
