          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoah Dawdi was orjooga Yese sugoocheanda ambal Israeleesean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea damanda ambaleewa Israeli, gweanyeeka ea haradam gweanyeew ispwa goombal Hebroni, nea gweanyeew diktam ea damasamwagu goombal Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghami nea gaba gweanyeeka miyaas, nea nilang'u aba askwearjoojiga, ea haleanjeeda, ea mureeda; ak ghoang'waay ng'eanyiida orjeedaanyi was Sulemani ak goombal hoorgeeda ghwaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi iita sugoocheanda was Dawdi, giing'eeta ea huuydeanda, ng'ula geeng'oorsa damanda askwearjoojiga Samweli, was siida deaha ng'asheega, ea damanda askwearjoojiga Natani was sibaneeda, ea damanda askwearjoojiga Gadi was siida deaha ng'asheega; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "earapeadi niimbal ng'eanyiidean aba uurdaanyi, ea ng'asheega nyas niny, ea Israeli, ea sugoodiga sean bea muunda ng'eanyiida.",
          "type": "text",
